<!doctype html>
<!-- Managed by Ansible. Do not edit by hand;
     change the role template.

     Served on the GET that follows a successful submission, so a browser
     refresh cannot send the application twice. It carries no placeholder: the
     handler serves these bytes unchanged, and its self-test asserts that. -->
