{% include 'grant-form-logo.html.j2' %}
<h1>Thanks!</h1>

<p>We got your application. It was locked (encrypted) as soon as it arrived, and only the volunteers who handle applications can open it. They pass it on to the committee.</p>

<p>{{ listmonk_grant_form_cycle_notice }}</p>

<p>The committee reads every application. If yours makes the shortlist, we'll get in touch and invite you to pitch it to the community at a meeting.</p>

<p>If you left the contact fields blank, we can't reach you, so keep an eye out for the decision wherever {{ listmonk_grant_form_org_name }} announces it.</p>

<p>Our <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{ listmonk_grant_form_data_notice_url }}">data policy</a> says how long we keep your application and how to ask us to delete it sooner. The code for our mailing list and for this form is on <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="{{ listmonk_grant_form_source_url }}">our GitHub</a>.</p>
</main>
